  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Women Empowerment and Environmental Sustainability Acceleration Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to the strengthening of  rural women producers economic empowerment while advancing biodiversity conservation and ecosystem restoration in Latin America and the Caribbean. It builds government capacity to design supportive, gender-transformative policies; pilots gender transformative Farmer Field Schools in selected countries; develops guidelines/standards to certify sustainable practices and improve womens market access; and scales learning through a regional knowledge-exchange platform and dissemination in strategic forums.</narrative>
  </description>
